<title>GERMANY: Wintershall - 97 results seen matching 96 results.</title>
<headline>Wintershall - 97 results seen matching 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>KASSEL, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wintershall AG, the energy subsidiary of German chemicals and drugs group BASF AG, said on Wednesday that its 1997 profits and sales would at least match 1996 results.</p>
<p>Last year the group posted sales of 5.55 billion marks ($3.2 billion) and a pre-tax profit of 833 million marks. Net profits stood at 286 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.716 German Marks)</p>
</text>
